# wt1 (2026-10-29 night): world at HOME on the current elem driver, profiled (APS5_PROFILE_DRAW) with one trace window
# (APS5_TRACE_FRAMES=2850:16, inside base-0) and frame-time intervals (APS5_TRACE_SUMMARY_EVERY=10, APS5_TRACE_BENCH=1).
# A/B of the GPU concurrency we already have (APS5_LANE_SERIALIZE on = the async lane waits for lane 0, i.e. serial)
# and of the q0 drains at dispatch-cache misses (APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on = miss items, no drain).
base-0 240
lser-1 100 switch APS5_LANE_SERIALIZE on
miss-1 100 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
base-1 100
lser-2 100 switch APS5_LANE_SERIALIZE on
miss-2 100 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
base-2 100
